Node: dcid:IdBasedKgResolution
typeOf: dcid:EntityResolutionTypeEnum
name: "ID-based Knowledge Graph resolution"
description: "Requires resolution against the Data Commons Knowledge Graph entities based on their unique ID properties,like wikidataId."

Node: dcid:NameBasedKgResolution
typeOf: dcid:EntityResolutionTypeEnum
name: "Name-based Knowledge Graph resolution"
description: "Requires resolution against the Data Commons Knowledge Graph entities based on the name or description property."

