Node: dcid:Barrel
typeOf: dcid:VolumeUnitOfMeasure
name: "Barrel"
description: "A barrel is one of several units of volume applied in various contexts. In the worldwide oil industry,an oil barrel is defined as 42 US gallons,which is about 159 litres,[10] or 35 imperial gallons."
