Node: dcid:CoalConsumingSectorEnum
typeOf: dcid:Class
subClassOf: dcid:Enumeration
name: "CoalConsumingSectorEnum"

Node: dcid:ElectricUtility
typeOf: dcid:CoalConsumingSectorEnum,dcid:Class
subClassOf: dcid:Organization
name: "ElectricUtility"
description: "Power plants owned by regulated electric utilties","Electric utilities are companies that provide electricity and/or heat. They can be publicly or privately owned."

Node: dcid:ElectricUtilityNonCogen
typeOf: dcid:CoalConsumingSectorEnum,dcid:ElectricityProductionSectorEnum
name: "ElectricUtilityNonCogen"
description: "Power plants owned by regulated electric utilties that produce electricity only"

Node: dcid:ElectricUtilityCogen
typeOf: dcid:CoalConsumingSectorEnum,dcid:ElectricityProductionSectorEnum
name: "ElectricUtilityCogen"
description: "Power plants owned by regualted electric utilities that produce both electricity and useful heat"

Node: dcid:CommercialAndInstitutional
typeOf: dcid:CoalConsumingSectorEnum
name: "CommercialAndInstitutional"
description: "An energy-consuming sector that consists of service-providing facilities and equipment of businesses; Federal,State,and local governments; and other private and public organizations,such as religious,social,or fraternal groups. The commercial sector includes institutional living quarters. It also includes sewage treatment facilities. Common uses of energy associated with this sector include space heating,water heating,air conditioning,lightning,refrigeration,cooking,and running a wide variety of other equipment."

Node: dcid:CokePlants
typeOf: dcid:CoalConsumingSectorEnum
name: "CokePlants"
description: "Plants where coal is carbonized for the manufacture of coke in slot or beehive ovens."

Node: dcid:OtherIndustrial
typeOf: dcid:CoalConsumingSectorEnum
name: "OtherIndustrial"
description: "All industrial sector fuel use other than in ‘Coke Plants.’ An energy-consuming sector that consists of all facilities and equipment used for producing,processing,or assembling goods. The industrial sector encompasses the following types of activity manufacturing; agriculture,forestry,fishing and hunting; mining; and construction. Overall energy use in this sector is largely for process heat and cooling and powering machinery,with lesser amounts used for facility heating,air conditioning,and lighting."

Node: dcid:IndependentPowerProducers
typeOf: dcid:CoalConsumingSectorEnum,dcid:ElectricityProductionSectorEnum
name: "IndependentPowerProducers"
description: "Power plants owned by unregulated power companies (also called merchant generators)"

