description: "Since 2015,binge alcohol use for females has been defined as drinking four or more drinks on the same occasion on at least 1 day in the past 30 days."

Node: dcid:HeavyAlcoholUse
typeOf: dcid:AlcoholUsageEnum
name: "HeavyAlcoholUse"
description: "Heavy Alcohol Use is defined as binge drinking on the same occasion on each of 5 or more days in the past 30 days; all heavy alcohol users are also binge alcohol users."

